H2('The brief and the rules', 'brief')
P('On 5 October I opened a new project called ZenRay Vegetation Collection 01. The plan was three vegetation assets in the same Houdini scene, each one after a different post by Erwan Gaudichon: a [lily](https://www.artstation.com/artwork/VyE3V4), a [pampas grass](https://www.artstation.com/artwork/a0gxvk) and a [eucalyptus](https://www.artstation.com/artwork/5WVB5w). I downloaded the 23 images of the three posts in 4K and cut them into reference sheets: material crops and component sheets.')
