P('The workflow follows a few rules, refined during the first hours:')
UL(['**A reference is measured, never copied.** Masks, profiles and tables are allowed. A reference image that a node reads, resizes, blends or traces is not.',
    '**Real nodes only in Copernicus.** No VEX, no wrangle, no Python inside a graph. Python builds the graph and measures it, the nodes carry the shape.',
    '**One band at a time.** A band is finished, or declared provisional, before the next one opens, and I validate it.',
    '**Iterate by blocks.** A block of up to 64 nodes to explore, then an optimisation pass that removes what does not matter.',
    '**Every iteration leaves an image,** in a folder called versions, before the next one starts.',
    '**Seamless by construction.** A whole number of cells and a Wrap border, never a cut that is glued afterwards.',
    '**At most eight parameters per folder** on an HDA. The rest stays inside the network.',
    '**Never rebuild what I tuned by hand,** a light, a camera, a material value, without asking.'])
